PART B — MODEL WEIGHTS
======================================================================

The trained model files listed under SCOPE above are licensed under the
PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0, reproduced in full below. For those
files, "the software" in the license text below means those model files.

The following line is the notice referred to by the "Notices" section of that
license. Anyone who passes on the model must pass this line on with it:

Required Notice: SubPixR model weights, Copyright 2026 The SubPixR Authors (https://github.com/asergiu-ubb/SubPixR). Trained on renders of the Replica dataset; noncommercial research use only.

The license text below is reproduced unmodified. The "Yoyodyne, Inc." line in
it is part of the standard text — an example of the notice format, not our
copyright notice.

